# UX workflow: validate the direct Pattern/Step grammar and Structure workspace.
# Purpose: proves short NAV stays on the musical hot path, NAV hold opens the
# explicit Track/Pattern hierarchy, and Back restores the exact Step caller.
# Expect: capture_match:pattern_after_cursor_move=pattern_after_hot_roundtrip, capture_match:step_caller_before_structure=step_caller_restored, capture_match:step_caller_before_structure=step_caller_restored_after_hierarchy

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen root_pattern_initial

# Short NAV cycles only Pattern <-> Step. Move the Step cursor so caller
# restoration proves more than a header-only scope change.
150 tap NAV 60
350 encoder NAV 3
550 capture screen step_caller_before_structure
650 tap NAV 60
850 capture screen pattern_after_cursor_move
950 tap NAV 60
1150 capture screen step_caller_before_structure_again
1200 tap NAV 60
1400 capture screen pattern_after_hot_roundtrip
1450 tap NAV 60

# NAV hold opens Structure / Tracks. Previewing +Track must not mutate until
# confirmation; LEFT_TOP closes Structure and restores Step 4 exactly.
1550 button NAV down
2620 tick
2680 capture screen structure_tracks_open
2730 button NAV up
2930 encoder NAV 1
3130 capture screen structure_add_track_preview
3230 tap LEFT_TOP 60
3480 capture screen step_caller_restored

# The second visit traverses Tracks -> Patterns -> Tracks, then returns to the
# same musical caller without leaking a structural focus into the hot cycle.
3580 button NAV down
4650 tick
4710 capture screen structure_tracks_reopened
4760 button NAV up
4960 tap NAV 60
5210 capture screen structure_patterns_open
5310 tap LEFT_TOP 60
5560 capture screen structure_tracks_after_back
5660 tap LEFT_TOP 60
5910 capture screen step_caller_restored_after_hierarchy
